#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:7 4e64b72e517542cea0b9789db122fd99
msgid "LAND Mode"
msgstr "LAND 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:9 fd79152031aa4ce28b93c39bfd66b764
msgid ""
"Auto Land is set by the mission control scripting only. Throttle and "
"altitude is controlled by the autopilot. After getting closer "
"``LAND_FLARE_ALT`` meters from the target altitude or ``LAND_FLARE_SEC`` "
"seconds from the target landing point the plane will \"flare\" to the "
"``LAND_PITCH_DEG`` pitch (in degrees) and will hold heading for the final "
"approach."
msgstr ""
"自动降落仅由任务控制脚本设置。油门和高度由飞控控制。在距目标高度 ``LAND_FLARE_ALT`` 米或距目标着陆点 "
"``LAND_FLARE_SEC`` 秒内，飞机将「拉平」到 ``LAND_PITCH_DEG`` 俯仰角（度），并在最终进近时保持航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:16 7c2bef99dbc64b28a35b06fb3988a608
msgid ""
"Setting up Plane for reliable auto-takeoff and landing is very airframe "
"dependent, and it is recommended that you first get some experience flying "
"your aircraft in FBWA mode, and be ready to take over control in manual or "
"FBWA mode the first few times you use an automatic takeoff or landing."
msgstr ""
"设置 Plane 以实现可靠的自动起飞和降落非常依赖于机架，建议先在 FBWA 模式下获得一些飞行经验，并在前几次使用自动起飞或降落时准备好在手动或 "
"FBWA 模式下接管控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:22 c9a8c36a0bca43f3a79904cd1ac9d974
msgid ""
"You should also look through the complete list of parameters, as there are a"
" lot of parameters that help control takeoff and landing for different "
"situations."
msgstr "您还应该查阅完整的参数列表，因为有大量参数可以帮助控制不同情况下的起飞和降落。"
